If 'the postbag's size is not 26 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-53: expected 26 got {'the postbag's size}", Exit 95. Print 'the postbag's size.
Read line from 'the drawer' into 'the postbag'.
If 'the postbag's size is not 36 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-52: expected 36 got {'the postbag's size}", Exit 95. Print 'the postbag's size.
a boolean called 'the postbag found an error already pending' is false.
