Close 'the shipping label'.
If 'the shipping label present path' is not available then, Print "ASSERT FIL-70: expected available got missing", Exit 95. Print "available".
If 'the shipping label absent path' is available then, Print "ASSERT FIL-70: expected missing got available", Exit 95. Print "missing".

